@AllSports.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### ── AUTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Register a new user (expect 201)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@allsports.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 2. Login with correct credentials (expect 200 + token)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@allsports.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. Login with wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@allsports.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

###

### 4. Login with non-existent email (expect 401)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@allsports.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 5. Register duplicate email (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@allsports.com",
  "password": "AnotherPass123!"
}

###

### 6. Register with invalid email format (expect 400)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 7. Register with short password (expect 400 — MinLength 8)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short@allsports.com",
  "password": "abc"
}

###

### 8. Login with missing fields (expect 400)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

###

### 9. Register — email case-insensitivity check (expect 409, same user as #1)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "TEST@AllSports.COM",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 10. Login — email case-insensitivity check (expect 200, same user as #1)
POST {{AllSports.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "TEST@AllSports.COM",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### ── DARTS (existing endpoints — verify not broken) ─────────────────────────

